    <string name="howto_title_sudoku">How to play: Sudoku</string>
    <string name="howto_sudoku_1">Fill the 9x9 board so every row, every column and every 3x3 box holds the numbers 1 to 9 once.</string>
    <string name="howto_sudoku_2">Tap an empty cell, then a number below. The cells that are already filled can not be changed.</string>
    <string name="howto_sudoku_3">A wrong number counts as a mistake and shows in red. The 3rd mistake loses the game. A correct number is final.</string>
    <string name="howto_sudoku_4">Turn on the pencil to write small notes of the numbers a cell could be. The eraser takes back a wrong number or clears the notes.</string>
    <string name="howto_sudoku_5">Every board can be solved by logic alone, so you never have to guess.</string>
