    <string name="howto_title_lights">How to play: Lights out</string>
    <string name="howto_lights_1">Put out every light on the board.</string>
    <string name="howto_lights_2">Tapping a light switches it and the lights right above, below, left and right of it: the ones that were on go out, the ones that were off come on.</string>
    <string name="howto_lights_3">There is no losing. If you get lost, start again from the beginning. Your moves keep counting. Tapping the same light twice cancels out.</string>
    <string name="howto_lights_4">Every board can be solved. The number next to the moves tells in how many taps at most.</string>
